Fix TorchScript export for filtering, RNNT loss, and masking transforms.

TorchAudio 2.9.1 cannot export several filtering functions, RNNT loss, and
masking transforms through TorchScript. Add script/trace-safe wrappers around
the custom autograd functions and normalize the masking value type before
calling mask_along_axis.

This backports the source changes from the following upstream commits while
omitting their CI-only changes:
https://github.com/pytorch/audio/commit/3fc07b5427031f58a8aabe0d44e8d0a3a50cc777
https://github.com/pytorch/audio/commit/744912eee04c9ae5b336868b0ff02fced3843d0c

